message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Astana UHI-DSS: code for urban heat island analysis in Astana"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Khussanbayev
    given-names: Gafur
    affiliation: "Astana IT University, Astana, Kazakhstan"
