repository-code: "https://github.com/Gafurk/astana-uhi-dss"
keywords:
  - urban heat island
  - land surface temperature
  - Google Earth Engine
  - machine learning
  - Astana
abstract: >-
  Google Earth Engine and Python code for modelling summer land surface
  temperature over Astana, Kazakhstan, from open satellite data, and for a
  before-and-after analysis of two greening projects, as reported in the
  article "Designing a GIS-Based Decision Support System for Urban Heat Island
  Analysis Using Big Data".
